       <string>D	Means packed-BCD number.</string></para>
      <para unique="1261267" format="TableFootnote">
       <string>*	Indicates floating-point invalid-operation (#IA) exception.</string></para>
      <para unique="1261268" format="TableFootnote">
       <string>**	</string><string>&#177;0 or </string><string>&#177;1, depending on the rounding mode.</string></para>
